": "ss-5.png", "id": "2234956736877025", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031421_2234956743543691_7041318165616746897_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRoP9br-_KUQ7kNvwEC3OgV&_nc_oc=AdlEzh4FCN9f_Dp5G_4469DIn606tMVODzLIUKkkFR4lM5GQsVhYQaPuIN9oHrsEdMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvMiEgRs00U0gm28qIRd78V5YZoiUEIdrjCrKgkhJnrkQ&oe=69A6E9D1"}, {"file_name": "ss-4.png", "id": "1102742384541135", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223470_1102742387874468_5690116116704421764_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=85Z8cgjMDYAQ7kNvwGlbykL&_nc_oc=AdnFov0vqx2CSVYzfpm2DEL2zoeLwVbC1g_VLqIzm-1Al3Cfz4Vgdv6drahRbeTwK6g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvclFB0EOgJSelEv3A_4eS3vHxMtUag97ZJIIgFIK7vtg&oe=69A6D125"}, {"file_name": "ss-3.png", "id": "432950273136799", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566688_432950276470132_6296901410558271266_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RhLWbG9YL90Q7kNvwFUYnVb&_nc_oc=Adn1XcG2heCzMgUeCBaVvD_KnON7U5wyfYjBAbJ51lag3KjTkx_JkmM9NoFAISIVOIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu05INrRxBZ7KaiSU7zcUsJOUH86fqyZO0H0UAmOEx_1g&oe=69A6C535"}, {"file_name": "ss-1.png", "id": "990870309506933", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974746_990870312840266_8219670313969916413_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y0Tdjwh-004Q7kNvwHrlnfl&_nc_oc=AdlM0RdxTluOnoXuQXOBHca7VzCQk0ROoPi-inHVCpB_EqaxOHkr8khiwlJ-rXCNmiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsiqmaN6gWZ6ogpDjlOA3oEQsfT9AM3bpV6H26SlEpETg&oe=69A6E7E6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "video-thumb.png", "id": "896068849090374", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_896068852423707_6468028910789789512_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=beFmqKYzh-MQ7kNvwEbSQx1&_nc_oc=AdkfnGpm7WMfrhcrRdMWIi1vYSJuVt5AN3_kZ-sc9pWKp0sxXlnUsqyqkoamHBiDaAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftwBuqkNLTIdsEJ_NWsOb4ApS__e7WUyHCqOUhxtIu2Cw&oe=69A6C354"}, "display_name": "BTI: VR Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Key Features:\n\nHands-On Learning: Enhance your hands-on experience with a realistic virtual lab setting, ideal for BTI\u2019s BioSTART and Laboratory Associates Program.\n\nSelf-Paced Learning: Progress through learning modules at your own pace with built-in evaluations, ensuring you develop competencies before advancing.\n\nHaptic Feedback: Feel like you're performing real tasks with tactile feedback from the controllers.\n\nInstructor Monitoring: Instructors can track your progress and practice frequency, ensuring a smooth transition from virtual to real-world competency.\n\nAccessibility: Break down traditional barriers to training, providing more opportunities for underrepresented demographics.\n\nAdult Learning Principles: The program aligns with the principles of adult learning for effective skill development.", "short_description": "BTI VR Training is a cutting-edge training tool for the biotechnical sector, ideal for those entering the biotech industry. It combines practical lab simulations with interactive theoretical lessons, providing a comprehensive learning experience. This application is a key resource for acquiring essential lab skills, serving as a bridge to the dynamic biotech world."}]}, "developer_name": "Capitol Interactive LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.virtualapprentice.net/privacy-policy/new-portfolio-item-jjw66", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Apprentice LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://btiworks.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_